er></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_timestampBlock__frqdc"><span class="HeroArticleTile_timestamp__Z0i6n">June 17, 2022</span></div></div></article></a></div><div class="NewsHero_aside__OnlCW"><ul class="RelatedArticleBlock_rab__4xdtb"><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-warriors-103-celtics-90-yzfta8" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-6:-warriors-103,-celtics-90" data-section-pos="11/20" data-content="Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" data-content-id="794933" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2022 NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/USATSI_18549129-1-scaled.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/USATSI_18549129-1-scaled.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/USATSI_18549129-1-scaled.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/><div class="VideoThumbnail_base__yet4f"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="PlayVideoIcon_icon__vHhLK PlayVideoIcon_triangle__OB0w4" data-no-icon="true" role="presentation" style="height:24px;width:24px"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="m10.15 7.35-4.9 3.15V4.2z"></path></svg><span class="VideoThumbnail_runtime__oJK3B">03:09</span></div></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-warriors-103-celtics-90-yzfta8" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-6:-warriors-103,-celtics-90" data-section-pos="11/20" data-content="Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" data-content-id="794933" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2022 NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics" data-live-vod="vod"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Led by Stephen Currys 34 points (6-11 3pt FG), seven rebounds and seven assists, the Golden State Warriors defeated the Boston Celtics in Game six, 103-90. Andrew Wiggins (18 points, six rebounds, five assists, four steals, three blocks) and Draymond Green (12 points, 12 rebounds, eight assists) added a combined 30 points for the Warriors in the victory, while Jaylen Brown tallied 34 points and seven rebounds for the Celtics. With the victory, the Warriors have secured the franchises 7th NBA title, passing the Chicago Bulls (6) for the 3rd most championships in NBA history.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-warriors-103-celtics-90-yzfta8" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-6:-warriors-103,-celtics-90" data-section-pos="11/20" data-content="Game Recap: Warriors 103, Celtics 90" data-content-id="794933" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2022 NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/6-takeaways-from-the-warriors-2022-nba-finals-clinching-win-over-the-celtics" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 6 takeaways from the Warriors&#x27; 2022 NBA Finals-clinching win over the Celtics" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-6:-warriors-103,-celtics-90" data-section-pos="11/20" data-content="6 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; championship victory" data-content-id="795032" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/stephen-curry-celebrates-finals-mvp.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/stephen-curry-celebrates-finals-mvp.jpg?w=735&amp;h=413 1x, https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/stephen-curry-celebrates-finals-mvp.jpg?w=1470&amp;h=826 2x" alt="6 takeaways from the Warriors&#x27; 2022 NBA Finals-clinching win over the Celtics" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/news/6-takeaways-from-the-warriors-2022-nba-finals-clinching-win-over-the-celtics" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 6 takeaways from the Warriors&#x27; 2022 NBA Finals-clinching win over the Celtics" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-6:-warriors-103,-celtics-90" data-section-pos="11/20" data-content="6 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; championship victory" data-content-id="795032" data-premium="false"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">6 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; championship victory</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Golden State looks flawless in clincher, Stephen Curry&#x27;s legacy continues to grow and Jayson Tatum isn&#x27;t quite at superstar status after a rough NBA Finals.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/6-takeaways-from-the-warriors-2022-nba-finals-clinching-win-over-the-celtics" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 6 takeaways from the Warriors&#x27; 2022 NBA Finals-clinching win over the Celtics" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-6:-warriors-103,-celtics-90" data-section-pos="11/20" data-content="6 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; championship victory" data-content-id="795032" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></d