_rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">5 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; Game 5 victory</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Andrew Wiggins steps up, Jaylen Brown steps back, and the Warriors are 1 step away from the title.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/5-takeaways-from-the-warriors-game-5-victory-in-2022-nba-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 5 takeaways from the Warriors&#x27; Game 5 victory in 2022 NBA Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="4/4" data-section="game-5:-warriors-104,-celtics-94" data-section-pos="12/20" data-content="5 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; Game 5 victory" data-content-id="793258" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="NewsHero_newsBase__zawGu" data-has-siderail="true" template="default"><div class="MaxWidthContainer_mwc__ChCs_ NewsHero_newsContainer__ZdFPX" data-padding="false" data-ad-slot="false" data-max-width="xl"><h2 class="Text_text__6vd08 BlockTitle_base__2GNiO NewsHero_blockTitle__wO_lF" data-small="false" data-hide-small-border="false"><p class="NewsHero_title__SoOe3">GAME 4: WARRIORS 107, CELTICS 97</p></h2><div class="NewsHero_hero__eVhH3"><div class="NewsHero_heroInner__0r0eZ"><a href="/game/gsw-vs-bos-0042100404" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 HeroArticleTile_link___eTGD" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for NBA Finals Game 4: Warriors vs. Celtics" data-sponser="false" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpo