 Recap: Warriors 107, Celtics 97" data-content-id="791422" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2022 NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics" data-live-vod="vod"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Game Recap: Warriors 107, Celtics 97</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Behind Steph Curry&#x27;s memorable 43-point performance and Andrew Wiggins&#x27; double-double, Golden State takes Game 4 to pull even at 2-2.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/watch/video/game-recap-warriors-107-celtics-97-02abkk" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Game Recap: Warriors 107, Celtics 97" data-track="video" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-4:-warriors-107,-celtics-97" data-section-pos="13/20" data-content="Game Recap: Warriors 107, Celtics 97" data-content-id="791422" data-premium="false" data-franchise="Game Recap" data-cat-type="2022 NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics" data-live-vod="vod"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/5-takeaways-from-the-warriors-series-tying-game-4-victory-in-2022-nba-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 5 takeaways from the Warrior