eve Kerr makes a crucial choice in the 4th and more thoughts as the Warriors retake homecourt advantage.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/5-takeaways-from-the-warriors-series-tying-game-4-victory-in-2022-nba-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 5 takeaways from the Warriors&#x27; series-tying Game 4 victory in 2022 NBA Finals" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="3/4" data-section="game-4:-warriors-107,-celtics-97" data-section-pos="13/20" data-content="5 takeaways from Warriors&#x27; series-tying win" data-content-id="791472" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/the-finals-stat-game-4-stephen-curry-continues-lighting-it-up-from-3" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for The Finals Stat, Game 4: Stephen Curry continues lighting it up from 3" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="4/4" data-section="game-4:-warriors-107,-celtics-97" data-section-pos="13/20" data-content="The Finals Stat: Curry keeps cooking from deep" data-content-id="791074" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/curry-deep-3-game-4.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2