/horford-celebration-game-1.jpg?w=1568&amp;h=882 2x" alt="NBA Finals, Game 1: Celtics vs. Warriors" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_summary___I_yz"><div class="HeroArticleTile_summaryInner__nRi3g"><header data-type="headline"><h3 class="Text_text__6vd08 HeroArticleTile_title__Jxrmr"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Celtics catch fire in 4th, stun Warriors in Game 1</span></h3><p class="Text_text__6vd08 HeroArticleTile_subtitle__doqz4"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">Al Horford scores 26 points, including a career-high six 3-pointers, and Boston uses a 17-0 run in the 4th quarter to rally past Golden State in NBA Finals opener.</span></p></header></div><div class="HeroArticleTile_timestampBlock__frqdc"><span class="HeroArticleTile_timestamp__Z0i6n">June 3, 2022</span></div></div></article></a></div><div class="NewsHero_aside__OnlCW"><ul class="RelatedArticleBlock_rab__4xdtb"><li class="RelatedArticleBlock_rabItem__YsG2A"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55" data-padding="true" data-featured="true" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/5-takeaways-from-celtics-stunning-2022-nba-finals-game-1-victory-over-warriors" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for 5 takeaways from Celtics&#x27; shocking 2022 NBA Finals Game 1 victory over Warriors" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:top-story-module:card" data-pos="2/4" data-section="game-1:-celtics-120,-warriors-108" data-section-pos="16/20" data-content="5 takeaways from Celtics&#x27; Game 1 victory" data-content-id="787899" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThu