oments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot helps secure win in Game 7" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:newsstripshort:card" data-pos="18/24" data-section="top-finals-moments" data-section-pos="19/20" data-content="Top Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot secures title" data-content-id="593846" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2017/05/don-nelson-1969.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2017/05/don-nelson-1969.jpg?w=384&amp;h=224 1x" alt="Top NBA Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot helps secure win in Game 7" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/news/history-finals-moments-don-nelsons-shot-helps-secure-win-in-game-7" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Top NBA Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot helps secure win in Game 7" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:newsstripshort:card" data-pos="18/24" data-section="top-finals-moments" data-section-pos="19/20" data-content="Top Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot secures title" data-content-id="593846" data-premium="false"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Top Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot secures title</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">In 1969, Don Nelson&#x27;s jumper in Game 7 gave the Celtics the cushion they needed to get Boston another NBA title.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/history-finals-moments-don-nelsons-shot-helps-secure-win-in-game-7" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Top NBA Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot helps secure win in Game 7" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:newsstripshort:card" data-pos="18/24" data-section="top-finals-moments" data-section-pos="19/20" data-content="Top Finals moments: Don Nelson&#x27;s shot secures title" data-content-id="593846" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></div></li><li class="NewsStrip_nsItem__w0qp8"><div class="ArticleTile_tile__YVZ55 NewsStrip_nsArticle__hzZzi" data-padding="true" data-featured="false" data-podcast="false" data-sponser="false"><article class="ArticleTile_tileArticle__yiOwT"><a href="/news/history-finals-moments-michael-jordan-layup-1991-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileThumnailLink__rzBfB" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Top NBA Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s mid-air, switch-handed layup" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:newsstripshort:card" data-pos="19/24" data-section="top-finals-moments" data-section-pos="19/20" data-content="Top Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s switch-handed layup" data-content-id="592800" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileImage__AdgpH"><figure data-type="image" class="VideoThumbnail_figure__gfHhD ArticleTile_tileThumbnail__XIMaF" style="height:100%"><img src="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2020/09/michael-jordan-finals-layup-1991-archive.jpg" srcSet="https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2020/09/michael-jordan-finals-layup-1991-archive.jpg?w=384&amp;h=224 1x" alt="Top NBA Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s mid-air, switch-handed layup" class="VideoThumbnail_image___FrxU" loading="lazy"/></figure></div></a><div class="ArticleTile_tileMain__rcp49"><div class="ArticleTile_tileMainContent__kMfmf"><a href="/news/history-finals-moments-michael-jordan-layup-1991-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileHeadlineLink___NLZQ" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Top NBA Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s mid-air, switch-handed layup" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:newsstripshort:card" data-pos="19/24" data-section="top-finals-moments" data-section-pos="19/20" data-content="Top Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s switch-handed layup" data-content-id="592800" data-premium="false"><header data-type="headline"><h4 class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileTitle__rfEPH"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:3">Top Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s switch-handed layup</span></h4><p class="Text_text__6vd08 ArticleTile_tileSub__JlCp5"><span class="MultiLineEllipsis_ellipsis__mpkNo" style="-webkit-line-clamp:2">In Game 2 of the 1991 Finals, Michael Jordan sank a must-see layup against the Lakers.</span></p></header></a></div><div class="ArticleTile_tileMeta__RljPE"><a href="/news/history-finals-moments-michael-jordan-layup-1991-finals" class="Anchor_anchor__wnmj2 ArticleTile_tileMetaLink___ZvfC" data-is-external="false" data-has-more="false" data-has-children="true" title="Article link for Top NBA Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s mid-air, switch-handed layup" data-track="click" data-type="card" data-id="nba:tentpole-hub:newsstripshort:card" data-pos="19/24" data-section="top-finals-moments" data-section-pos="19/20" data-content="Top Finals moments: Michael Jordan&#x27;s switch-handed layup" data-content-id="592800" data-premium="false"><div class="ArticleTile_tileTimestampSkeleton__8UET4 ArticleTile_tileTimestamp__73NJq"></div></a></div></div></article></d