NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics","slug":"2022-nba-finals"},"contentStructured":""}]}},{"id":12,"type":"collection","title":"GAME 5: WARRIORS 104, CELTICS 94","value":{"layout":"top_story","collectionTitle":"GAME 5: WARRIORS 104, CELTICS 94","collectionContent":[{"id":792921,"type":"hyperlink","name":"nba-finals-game-5-warriors-vs-celtics","title":"NBA Finals Game 5: Warriors vs. Celtics","status":"publish","slug":"nba-finals-game-5-warriors-vs-celtics","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/game/bos-vs-gsw-0042100405","excerpt":"Warriors All-Star Andrew Wiggins puts up 26 points and 13 rebounds as Golden State pushes Boston to the brink with a 4th-quarter flurry.","timestamp":1655169073000,"date":"2022-06-14T01:11:13Z","modified":"2022-06-14T12:21:26Z","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/andrew-wiggins-driving-game-5-celtics.jpg","category":"","url":"https://www.nba.com/game/bos-vs-gsw-0042100405","shortTitle":"Wiggins double-double powers Warriors to 3-2 lead","appUrl":"gametime://game/20220613/BOSGSW","ctaText":""},{"id":793183,"type":"video","name":"game-recap-warriors-104-celtics-94","title":"Game Recap: Warriors 104, Celtics 94","status":"publish","slug":"game-recap-warriors-104-celtics-94","permalink":"https://www.nba.com/watch/video/game-recap-warriors-104-celtics-94","excerpt":"Led by Andrew Wiggins 26 points and 13 rebounds, the Golden State Warriors defeated the Boston Celtics in Game five, 104-94. Klay Thompson (21 points, 5-11 3pt FG) and Stephen Curry (16 points, eight assists, 0-9 3pt FG) added a combined 37 points for the Warriors in the victory, while Jayson Tatum led all scorers with 27 points and 10 rebounds for the Celtics. The Warriors lead this best-of-seven series 3-2, with Game six taking place on Thursday, June 16","timestamp":1655182937000,"date":"2022-06-14T05:02:17Z","modified":"2025-01-14T20:19:39Z","featuredImage":"https://cdn.nba.com/manage/2022/06/BOS_GSW_G5_061322-2.jpg","category":"2022 NBA Finals: Warriors vs. Celtics,Gam